        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "skill",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>Thanks to your constant involvement with cryptic texts, you have attained an almost-supernatural ability to decipher complex codes and understand ancient writings. You can always use [[/act decipher-writing skill=occultism]]{Occultism} or [[/act decipher-writing skill=religion]]{Religion} when you @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Decipher Writing], no matter the subject matter. In addition, you can ignore language constraints when Deciphering Writing, and when you critically fail to Decipher Writing, you get a failure instead.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 4
          },
